        "expression": "jython:import re\nvalue = re.sub(r'[_-]', '', value)\nmatch = re.search(r'\\b(\\d{1,2}):(\\d{2})\\s([A|P]M)', value)\nif match:\n  hour, minute, am_pm = match.groups()\n  if am_pm == 'PM' and int(hour) != 12:\n    hour = str(int(hour) + 12)\n  elif am_pm == 'AM' and int(hour) == 12:\n    hour = '00'\n  value = f'{hour}:{minute}'\nreturn value",
        "onError": "set-to-blank",
        "repeat": false,
        "repeatCount": 10,
        "description": "Text transform on cells in column act_dep_time using expression jython:import re\nvalue = re.sub(r'[_-]', '', value)\nmatch = re.search(r'\\b(\\d{1,2}):(\\d{2})\\s([A|P]M)', value)\nif match:\n  hour, minute, am_pm = match.groups()\n  if am_pm == 'PM' and int(hour) != 12:\n    hour = str(int(hour) + 12)\n  elif am_pm == 'AM' and int(hour) == 12:\n    hour = '00'\n  value = f'{hour}:{minute}'\nreturn value"
